like it didn't work, not good.
就像是行不通，感觉很糟糕。

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:55.230
You know, like, you've got to try to figure out like who you are and what your kind of recipe is for living.
你知道的，你得去摸索自己究竟是谁，以及你的人生信条是什么。

00:11:55.230 --> 00:12:02.149
And your 20s are where you really experiment in ways that are sometimes disastrous and oftentimes illuminating.
而在你二十多岁的时候，你会真正去进行各种尝试，这些尝试有时会带来灾难，但往往也充满了启发。

